        },
        "f_text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Each package holds one 5.5 oz skin-on, hot-smoked rainbow trout fillet &mdash; ready to eat, rich and smoky.</p><p>Our Smoked Trout Filets tested at 134 mg EPA and 630 mg DHA per fillet. Values vary by sample and season.</p><p>Every supplier is third-party tested for nutrition, mercury and microplastics, then randomly audited to ensure consistent compliance with the Seatopia Standard. Farms named, panels published.</p>",
